OL,4,CVillage's concern over sewage          
OL,5,Cdischarge in dry river                 
OL,6,GA group of residents have said pools   
OL,7,Gof treated sewage are forming on a dry 
OL,8,Griverbed that runs through their       
OL,9,Gvillage during drought conditions.     
OL,11,FThey are calling for the Environment   
OL,12,FAgency to stop the sewage treatment    
OL,13,Fplant in Peterchurch, Herefordshire,   
OL,14,Fdischarging into the River Dore during 
OL,15,Fperiods of no flow.                    
OL,17,FAt the moment, Welsh Water legally     
OL,18,Fdischarges directly into the river,    
OL,19,Fbut campaigners said its permit        
OL,20,Fassumed the effluent would be diluted  
OL,21,Fby the river flow.                     
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
