OL,4,CZoo says sad farewell to Doris the     
OL,5,Carmadillo                              
OL,6,GA zoo in Telford has said goodbye to a 
OL,7,Gsix-banded armadillo called Doris, who 
OL,8,Glived to the grand old age of 19,      
OL,9,Gwinning a Blue Peter badge and helping 
OL,10,Gto educate thousands of visitors about 
OL,11,Gthe rainforest during her long life.   
OL,13,FAlong with her sibling Dillon, she     
OL,14,Fstarred in a short film for the Let's  
OL,15,FGo Club on CBeebies, and their 19th    
OL,16,Fbirthday was marked by BBC Newsround   
OL,17,Fearlier this year.                     
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
