OL,4,CUB40 star defends Rooney over I'm a    
OL,5,CCeleb singing                          
OL,6,GUB40 frontman Ali Campbell has         
OL,7,Gdefended Wayne Rooney for singing one  
OL,8,Gof the band's biggest hits, Rat In Mi  
OL,9,GKitchen, in a Jamaican accent on ITV's 
OL,10,GI'm a Celebrity Get Me Out of Here.    
OL,12,FThe former football star broke into    
OL,13,Fsong in Friday's episode, prompting    
OL,14,Fdebate online as to whether it was     
OL,15,Fcultural misappropriation.             
OL,17,FThe song was written by band member    
OL,18,FAstro, and Campbell questioned why     
OL,19,Fpeople would be offended at Rooney     
OL,20,Fimitating the vocal.                   
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
