OL,4,CRoyal ovation for BGT farmers 'left    
OL,5,Cchoir in tears'                        
OL,6,GA farmer who helped lead the Hawkstone 
OL,7,GFarmers Choir to victory on Britain's  
OL,8,GGot Talent has said singing for the    
OL,9,GKing and Queen at the Royal Variety    
OL,10,GPerformance was so emotional choir     
OL,11,Gmembers were left in tears.            
OL,13,FAndy Owens, from Marden,               
OL,14,FHerefordshire, was among the members   
OL,15,Fof the choir who took to the stage at  
OL,16,FLondon's Royal Albert Hall on Friday   
OL,17,Fafter winning this year's ITV talent   
OL,18,Fshow.                                  
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
